  "description": "I want to be just like you. \n\nGa-Bi miserably works a low-paying job at a nail salon. When Jin-Ju, an Instagram influencer who seems to have it all, visits the salon, Ga-Bi decides she wants to live her life. As Ga-Bi begins a double life of pretending to be just like Jin-Ju, their lives become more intertwined. What secrets of the Instagram celebrity will Ga-Bi uncover? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
